NOTE ON DATA AND MEDIA

The MIT licence above applies to the source code of this project.

Bundled data and media remain under the terms of their original providers:

  * Orbital elements (data/sats.json) — CelesTrak, https://celestrak.org/
  * Launch data fetched at runtime — The Space Devs, https://thespacedevs.com/
  * Earth textures (assets/tex/) — NASA Visible Earth, generally public domain
  * Satellite and mission imagery (assets/img/) — Wikimedia Commons,
    individual files carry their own licences (CC BY-SA, public domain, etc.)
  * Country boundaries (assets/geo/) — Natural Earth, public domain

Third-party libraries in assets/vendor/ are distributed under their own
licences: MapLibre GL JS (BSD-3-Clause), three.js (MIT), satellite.js (MIT).
